01:07:57,272 --> 01:08:03,272
The third installment in the Jason Bourne film series, the film was based on the 1990 novel of the same name by Robert Ludlum, and stars Matt Damon as former CIA assassin and psychogenic
amnesiac Jason Bourne, alongside an ensemble cast including Julia Stiles, David Strathairn, Scott Glenn, Paddy Considine, Édgar Ramírez, Albert Finney, and Joan Allen.

14
01:13:10,909 --> 01:13:16,909
In the film, Bourne continues his search for information about his past before he was part
of Operation Treadstone and becomes a target of a similar assassin program.

15
01:18:24,545 --> 01:18:30,545
Principal photography began in New York City on October 2, 2006.

16
01:23:38,181 --> 01:23:44,181
The Bourne Ultimatum premiered at ArcLight Hollywood on July 25, 2007, before being
theatrically released on August 3 in the United States, by Universal Pictures.

17
01:28:51,818 --> 01:28:57,818
It received acclaim from critics and grossed $444 million worldwide, becoming
Damon's highest-grossing film with a lead role at the time.

18
01:34:05,454 --> 01:34:11,454
It was chosen by National Board of Review as one of the top ten films of 2007, and went on to win all three of its
nominations at the 80th Academy Awards: Best Film Editing, Best Sound Mixing, and Best Sound Editing.

19
